														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2142474">
									

<p>Depends on exactly how badly our reputation is destroyed. We don't know how this thing affects galaxies on a small scale. It's shuffling the whole universe around, it's likely that it doesn't get the locations of the smaller objects EXACTLY right each time. Maybe the relative locations of things aren't preserved. Maybe solar systems and planets end up shifted ever-so-slightly, but enough to perhaps cause catastrophic disasters, wipe out entire civilizations, and maybe cause some to never even develop in the first place. Basically I'm saying when the aliens discover we have this thing, they may have good reason to be PISSED.</p>
